Capacity 1.6 t | Series 1120
Automated Storage Solutions
Precise and reliable automation solution for high-bay warehouses
â†’ Narrow working aisle width for higher density storage
â†’ Unique 3D camera for optimum load detection
â†’ Storage and retrieval up to a height of 11 meters
â†’ 360-degree safety monitoring to detect people or obstacles in the work area
â†’ Natural feature navigation without additional infrastructure
